# JAPAN LIVE — configuration template.
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local and edit. NEVER commit a filled-in copy.
#
# NOTHING SECRET BELONGS IN A VITE_ VARIABLE. Vite inlines these into the public
# bundle, so anyone can read them. The ODPT key lives in the gateway as a Worker
# secret — see the gateway section at the bottom.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web app (apps/web/.env.local)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Gateway base URL. LEAVE EMPTY to run in DEMO MODE with no credentials at all.
# Setting it switches the app to LIVE.
# VITE_GATEWAY_URL=https://japan-live-gateway.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev

# Dataset to load. Defaults to the bundled demo dataset.
# Switch to the real one after running `npm run data:gtfs`.
# VITE_DATASET_URL=data/odpt-dataset.json

# Cesium ion token used for PLATEAU terrain. Defaults to the public token MLIT
# publishes in its own terrain tutorial; override with your own if you prefer.
# VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
# VITE_PLATEAU_TERRAIN_ASSET_ID=3258112

# Self-hosted quantized-mesh terrain, bypassing Cesium ion entirely.
# VITE_TERRAIN_URL=https://example.com/terrain

# Basemap. Default is 地理院タイル 淡色地図.
# VITE_GSI_TILE_URL=https://cyberjapandata.gsi.go.jp/xyz/pale/{z}/{x}/{y}.png

# PLATEAU 3D Tiles. The catalog is resolved at runtime so no data year is hardcoded.
# Set VITE_PLATEAU_YEAR to pin a year instead of tracking latest.
# VITE_PLATEAU_CATALOG_URL=https://api.plateauview.mlit.go.jp/datacatalog/plateau-datasets
# VITE_PLATEAU_YEAR=
# VITE_BUILDINGS=1

# Performance and behaviour.
# VITE_MAX_TRAINS=2000
# VITE_SKIP_INTRO=0

# Base path for GitHub Pages. The deploy workflow sets this automatically.
# VITE_BASE=/japan-live-v1/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset build script (shell environment, NOT a VITE_ variable)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used only by `npm run data:gtfs`, on your machine. Never committed, never bundled.
# ODPT_CONSUMER_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gateway (apps/gateway) — set these with wrangler, not in a file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   wrangler secret put ODPT_CONSUMER_KEY      <- the secret; never in wrangler.toml
# And in wrangler.toml [vars]:
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://<user>.github.io    <- exact origins only, no wildcard
#   RATE_LIMIT_PER_MIN=120
